msgstr "Tack. Din återkoppling har skickats."

#: includes/product-feedback.php:242
msgid "Linked usage and lifecycle reports were deleted. Reporting is off."
msgstr ""
"Länkade användnings- och livscykelrapporter har raderats. Rapportering är "
